  "prompt_mode": "short_sentence_continuation",
  "prompt_text": "Continue the text below with exactly one short, natural, coherent English sentence. Return only the continuation, with no preamble or explanation:\nAll of the \"#1 Dad\" mugs in the world change to show the actual ranking of Dads suddenly.\n\nJoe sits in front of his mug in his basement. He told his family he is working, but he is not. He is drinking. He is drinking a lot. He is drinking to forget what a bad father he is. He is drinking to forget that he is the worst father in the world.\n\nHe had promised to take his 10-year old son to the Mets game. He had forgotten this, and instead stumbled in the door well past midnight. His son was asleep. On the table was a mug in a gift box. With it was a note: thanks for being such a great father and taking me to the Mets game. Love, your son.\n\nIn his basement, Joe looks at the mug. Before his eyes, the legend \"World's #1 Dad\" seems to waver, and then it changes.",
  "reference_single_token_nfa_states": 33,
